3. $1440 = 120\,[1 + 4.5\times10^{-3}(T - 26)]$
4. $\dfrac{1440}{120} = 12 = 1 + 4.5\times10^{-3}(T - 26)$ ⇒ $T - 26 = \dfrac{11}{4.5\times10^{-3}} = 2444.4$
